The '''industrial dockyard''' was a [[Hangar|docking facility]] located in an industrial area of [[Coronet City]], [[Corellia]]. The dockyard was located near a [[decommissioning facility]] which scrapped [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[battle droid]]s after the end of the [[Clone Wars]]. When the rogue [[Clone Force 99|Bad Batch]] was sent to [[Mission to a droid decommissioning facility|steal]] a [[tactical droid]] from the facility, they landed their [[starship]], the [[Marauder (Omicron-class)|''Marauder'']], at the industrial dockyard before proceeding to the scrapping facility on foot.<ref name="Decommissioned" />

